CATEGORIES:Workshops,MAP,CBD
DTSTAMP:20261008T043606Z
DESCRIPTION:What makes a character memorable? How does an idea become a story? And what can a superhero tell us about who we are?\n\nComic creator Falah Faisal\, creator of Musalman\, draws on nearly a decade of making comics to explore the building blocks of character\, story and identity. Through conversations\, prompts and hands-on exercises\, participants will develop their own superhero — from their origins and abilities to their world\, conflicts and stories.\n\nNo drawing skills required. Just bring your imagination and a story waiting to be told.
DTEND:20261018T073000Z
DTSTART:20261018T053000Z
SUMMARY:Make Your Own Superhero
UID:1420@map-india.org
URL:https://map-india.org/map-events/make-your-own-superhero/
END:VEVENT
